en:
Some of the selected mods (or their dependencies) are not supported on your current compatible game versions ({1}) and may not work at all. If you have any problems with them, you should NOT ask their maintainers for help.

{0}

Are you sure you want to install them? Cancelling will abort the entire installation.

zh:
您当前兼容的游戏版本({1}) 不支持所选模组(或其依赖)，可能根本无法运行。 如果你对此有任何问题，不建议向模组的维护者提供帮助。

{0}

您确定要安装它们吗？取消将中止整个安装。

en:
This version of CKAN is too old to load:
{0}
Update CKAN to load this game instance.

zh:
此版本的 CKAN 太旧无法加载:
{0}
更新 CKAN以加载游戏实例。

en:
Module {0} wants to overwrite the following manually installed files:

{1}

Overwrite?

zh:
模组 {0} 想要覆盖以下手动安装文件:

{1}

覆盖吗?

en:
Unable to overwrite or delete files for {0}:

{1}

If the game is still running, close it and try again. Otherwise check the permissions.

zh:
无法覆盖或删除 {0} 的文件：

{1}

如果游戏仍在运行， 关闭后再试一次。 否则请检查权限。

en:
Oh no! We tried to overwrite a file owned by another mod!

Please report it at:
https://github.com/KSP-CKAN/NetKAN/issues/new/choose

Include the following information in your report:

File: {0}
Installing Mod: {1}
Owning Mod: {2}

zh:
我们正在尝试去覆盖其它模组（或游戏本体）已经安装的文件！

如果这个问题反复出现，可能是由于打包时出现bug.
请在此处报告:

https://github.com/KSP-CKAN/NetKAN/issues/new/choose

报告时请包括以下信息:

File(文件)      : {0}
Installing Mod(正在安装的Mod) : {1}
Owning Mod(已有Mod): {2}

en:
Download failed with certificate error: {1}

Consult this page for help:
{0}

zh:
我们的下载由于证书错误失败了！

查看以下页面以获得帮助:
{0}

en:
{0}
Need to store {3} to {1}, but only {2} is available!
Free up space on that device or change your settings to use another location.

zh:
{0}
需要存储 {3} 到 {1}，但只有 {2} 可用！
释放该设备上的空间，或更改您的设置以使用另一个位置。
